/* =============================================================================
   Dabur eCommerce BI platform — interactive prototype (v3: UAE + KSA, Sales RCA, quick-commerce two-level cover, price guardrails)
   Single-file React (JSX) + Tailwind core utilities + Recharts + lucide-react + SheetJS (xlsx, for uploads)

   DATA ARCHITECTURE
   RAW (below) holds the *real* supplied records, transformed into a canonical
   structure by an offline audit step:
     - Amazon Vendor Central: Sales (shipped), Inventory, Net PPM   1–7 Sep 2026
     - Noon Sales Dynamics (Core / Supermall / Minutes, by warehouse) 1–7 Sep 2026
     - Noon daily revenue time series (all Noon)                    1 Jul–23 Sep 2026
     - Noon Minutes stock snapshot (3 central DCs + 190 dark stores) 24 Sep 2026
     - Noon sell-in / GRN to Noon warehouses                          Jul–Sep 2026
   buildModel() generates ~18 months of daily history per listing (Apr-2025 →
   23-Sep-2026) *anchored* to those records: real days are kept verbatim, Noon
   totals are calibrated to the real daily series, and synthetic days follow
   seasonality / trend / events. To go live, replace buildModel() with adapters
   that read the same canonical shape from the warehouse.
============================================================================= */
